net/minecraft/network/packet/c2s/play/PlayerInteractItemC2SPacket

note ClientPlayerEntity.ticksLeftToDoubleTapSprint = sprint double-tap window (7 ticks); reset while sneaking or using an item
note ClientPlayerEntity.ticksSinceSprintingChanged = counts UP every tick, reset to 0 by setSprinting (1.8.9 counted down)
note ClientPlayerEntity.inSneakingPose = crouching pose decision of tickMovement (also true when standing up would collide)
note ClientPlayerEntity.autoJumpEnabled = copied from the auto-jump option at the end of sendMovementPackets (so it lags one tick)
note ClientPlayerEntity.lastOnGround = a bare on-ground packet is sent only when this differs (no idle flying packets in 1.16)
note ClientPlayerEntity.field_3939 = unnamed: fall flying flag of the last tick (elytra)
note PlayerEntity.abilityResyncCountdown = misleading: the creative double-tap-jump flight toggle window (7 ticks)
note PlayerEntity.field_7509 = unnamed: base air acceleration 0.02 (flyingSpeed is set from it after travel; x1.3 sprinting)
note LivingEntity.flyingSpeed = misleading: acceleration used when not on ground; creative flight swaps in the fly speed during travel
note LivingEntity.method_26317 = unnamed: gravity inside fluids (velocity.y - gravity / 16, with the 0.003 snap near the surface)
note LivingEntity.method_26318 = unnamed: ground/air travel step: updateVelocity, climbing clamp, move, 0.2 climb when blocked or jumping on a ladder
note LivingEntity.method_31079 = unnamed: static helper returning (x, y, 0) of a vector
note LivingEntity.method_29920 = unnamed: "can sneak down in water" (true for players)
note LivingEntity.jumpingCooldown = 10-tick jump cooldown while jump is held on ground
note Entity.movementMultiplier = slow-movement multiplier set by cobweb / sweet berry bush contact, applied and cleared by the next move
note Entity.field_25599 = unnamed: tag of the fluid the eyes are submerged in
note Entity.firstUpdate = true until the first baseTick; fluid checks ignore lava while it is set
